# N7 Customer Value OS — environment variables
#
# NONE of these are required. The prototype builds and runs with no
# configuration, no database, no auth provider and no API keys.
#
# Never put a secret or third-party credential in a VITE_* variable: anything
# prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the browser bundle and is public.

# Optional. "demo" (default) runs deterministic local generation for the
# environment mapper. "controlPlane" selects the future server-side Clintware
# adapter, which is intentionally not configured in this prototype and will
# surface a clear "not configured" state instead of fabricating a result.
# VITE_N7_PROVIDER_MODE=demo

# Future server-side only (NOT VITE_-prefixed, never read in client code).
# These belong in a server function / Worker secret once a real control plane
# exists. No endpoint or auth scheme is assumed here.
# N7_CONTROL_PLANE_URL=
# N7_CONTROL_PLANE_TOKEN=